+## Scale and Load
+
+Rows exist only for paths a slice has designed against. A size nobody has measured reads "unrecorded, treated as bounded".
+
+| Path | Dominant operations | Realistic size | Access pattern | Form |
+|------|--------------------|----------------|----------------|------|
+| Specialty directory (`REQ-VET-003`) | One read of all specialties, one cached read of all veterinarians with eager specialties, one in-memory grouping | Unrecorded, treated as bounded; the seed holds three specialties and six veterinarians | Read-only full listing per request; unpaged by requirement | Two whole-collection reads plus one pass keyed by specialty identity: worst-case O(S + H) time and space, H the vet–specialty pairs. Simplest readable form |
